Package: mxHelper
Title: Helper Functions for 'OpenMx'
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Helper functions for 'OpenMx' models: matrices with labels,
    bounds, and vectors of free parameters; covariance matrices from the LDL
    decomposition with a softplus diagonal; starting values for vector
    autoregressive models; and fitting until the Hessian is positive
    definite, with diagnostics and bound handling.
    Each exported function has an internal version without input checks
    that other projects can copy.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/mxHelper,
        https://ijapesigan.github.io/mxHelper/
